    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will involve working closely with the client's to identify the specific requirements for the artificial intelligence solution, the efficiency and quality improvements needed, and the existing practices that need to be maintained. our will then proceed with a pilot phase on a limited scope, as required by the client's, to test and validate our approach. a pilot phase on a limited scope, as required by the client will allow our to refine the artificial intelligence solution, identify potential risks and issues, and make necessary adjustments before proceeding with the full rollout. our typical delivery structure consists of four phases: Inception & Design, Pilot / MVP, Full Rollout, and Operations & Support. our will adapt Our typical delivery structure to the client's needs, ensuring that our conduct The project in a progressive manner, with a pilot phase followed by a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure the success of The project, our will establish a steering committee, maintain a RAID log, and implement a change request process. our will also provide weekly status reports, monthly steering committee meetings, and quarterly executive reviews to keep the client informed of our progress. our team has experience in managing large projects, with an average project duration of 18 months and a largest project managed worth 4.5 million euros. our have completed 23 public sector projects and currently have six active projects." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With 87 employees and a strong background in digital transformation, AI solutions, and public sector IT, our are confident that our can deliver a high-quality solution that meets the client's needs. our will also ensure that the artificial intelligence solution is integrated with existing systems of information, business softwares, electronic management of documents, and user directories, as required by the client. our expertise in data protection and security will guarantee that the client's data is protected in an appropriate manner, using encryption and anonymization if necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Throughout The project, our will maintain a risk register, review risks bi-weekly, and ensure that the artificial intelligence solution complies with regulatory requirements. our will also provide training and accompaniment to change, as needed, to ensure a smooth transition for the client's agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By following this structured approach, leveraging our expertise and experience, and maintaining close communication with the client, our are confident that our can deliver a successful project that meets all the client's needs and requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires response time below 2 seconds, high level of availability (99.9%), integration with existing system of information, business softwares, electronic management of documents, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, using an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, and must guarantee strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these technical requirements, what is our proposed architecture for The solution?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our propose a cloud-based architecture that leverages our expertise in AI/ML systems, Cloud architecture, API integration, and Cybersecurity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the response time requirement of below 2 seconds, our will utilize our experience with containerisation using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s), which enables efficient deployment and scaling of applications. utilize, combined with our knowledge of inference servers such as vLLM, Ollama, or TGI (Hugging Face), ensures fast and reliable model serving." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For high availability, our aim to achieve the required 99.9% uptime by designing a highly available architecture that takes advantage of cloud providers' built-in redundancy and failover capabilities. our experience with cloud providers such as OVHcloud, Scaleway, Outscale (SecNumCloud), and Azure (the European Union regions) allows our to deploy The solution on an infrastructure that meets the the European Union hosting requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with the existing system of information, business softwares, electronic management of documents, and user directories, our will employ API standards such as REST, GraphQL, or SOAP (legacy), utilizing API gateways like Kong, Apigee, or AWS API Gateway. our experience with message brokers including Apache Kafka and RabbitMQ also facilitates integration with various systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data protection and GDPR compliance, our will implement security design patterns such as Zero-trust network architecture, VLAN segmentation, mTLS between services, AES-256 encryption at rest, and TLS 1.3 in transit." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our will use secrets management tools like HashiCorp Vault or CyberArk Conjur to securely manage sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the hosting requirement within the European Union, our can deploy The solution on a SecNumCloud-type infrastructure, such as Outscale (SecNumCloud), which ensures sovereignty over the data and compliance with the European Union regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, our experience with monitoring tools including Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack enables our to set up comprehensive monitoring and logging for the solution, ensuring prompt detection and resolution of any issues that may arise." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these technologies and our expertise, our can design a robust, scalable, and secure architecture that meets the client's technical requirements while ensuring strict GDPR compliance and high availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR), protection of data in an appropriate manner using encryption and anonymization if necessary, and no automation without explicit validation of an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also take into account regulatory requirements, environmental issues, and have a level of security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these constraints, what is our strategy for ensuring the security and compliance of The solution?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., has experience with regulatory frameworks including RGPD/GDPR, and our have a the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed, who can be contacted at dpo@nexus-engineering.it. our are ISO 27001 certified, which demonstrates our commitment to information security management. our certification scope includes the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) compliance, our will implement data protection by design and default, using anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models. our will also ensure that all data subject rights are implemented, including access, rectification, erasure, portability, and objection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For protecting data in an appropriate manner, our will use encryption and anonymization if necessary. our access control standards include multi-factor authentication (MFA) enforced with TOTP and hardware token (FIDO2), and role-based access control (RBAC) design experience. our also have experience with privileged access management (PAM) solutions such as CyberArk Conjur and HashiCorp Vault." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding automation, our will ensure that no automated decisions are made without explicit validation of an agent, in compliance with the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To take into account regulatory requirements, environmental issues, and to have a level of security, our will conduct regular Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs) and ensure that our solution is designed with security in mind from the outset. our average DPIA duration is 3 weeks, which allows our to quickly assess and mitigate any potential risks. our also have experience with SecNumCloud projects, which demonstrates our ability to work with secure cloud infrastructure. our network security architecture patterns include zero-trust, micro-segmentation, and defense-in-depth, and our have intrusion detection and prevention systems (IDS/IPS) deployed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, our will ensure that our solution is hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, in compliance with the client's sovereignty requirements. our will also rely as much as possible on low-carbon impact infrastructures to minimize our environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our strategy for ensuring the security and compliance of The solution is to leverage our existing experience and certifications, implement robust access controls and data protection measures, and conduct regular risk assessments to ensure that our meet all the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires compliance with regulatory requirements, respect of sovereignty of data, no transfer of data outside the European Union, and no dependence on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also be compliant with GDPR, EU AI Act, and other relevant regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these legal constraints, what are the key legal risks that we need to flag and mitigate in this project?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As Legal Counsel for Nexus Engineering S.r.l., Legal Counsel for Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have reviewed we company context and The client requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these legal constraints, the key legal risks that we need to flag and mitigate in this project include ensuring compliance with GDPR, as we default IP model is work-for-hire and all deliverables are transferred to The client upon final payment, which aligns with The client data ownership requirement.  we also need to ensure that we subcontractors, who must be EU-established, comply with GDPR, EU AI Act, and other relevant regulations. we subcontractor vetting process includes legal and financial due diligence plus exclusion grounds check, which should help mitigate risks associated with non-compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, as we are aware of EU AI Act and EU AI Act implications on limited-risk AI applications, we need to ensure that The solution complies with the transparency obligations and human oversight requirements stipulated in EU AI Act. we policy of not allowing automated decision-making without human validation also aligns with the transparency obligations and human oversight requirements stipulated in the Act." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding sovereignty and data protection, we must guarantee that all data is hosted exclusively within the European Union and protected appropriately, using measures such as encryption and anonymization if necessary. we current insurance coverage includes professional indemnity and cyber liability, which should provide some level of protection in case of data breaches or other cybersecurity incidents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, ensuring compliance with other relevant the European Union regulations and maintaining awareness of updates to other relevant EU regulations will be crucial in mitigating legal risks throughout this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

